{"about_the_game":"Land Drifters is a game about exploring new islands, leveling up new skills, and unlocks through progression!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe world is set in a medieval-style setting with many trade-skills to help you progress through the game. Mine precious ore and craft your strongest armor, battle against monsters to unlock new areas to explore. Claim your ship and set sail and drift to new lands to uncover their story with plenty of mysteries to uncover!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOver 100 skills and masteries to level up. Whether fishing mighty beasts, working with specific metals in smithing, honing your swordsmanship, or obtaining poison resistance through exposure, there will be a lot for you to enjoy and progress.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are also plenty of side activities to keep you busy if you choose. Claim rewards with optional cosmetic currency to spend in the game. Many of these activities range from fun games or educational, like learning languages, typing challenges, and more!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2294720?t=1767667262","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767667262","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294720/3c99a729ab6f22c83793f178e032d7f13bfcd7ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767667262","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294720/3c99a729ab6f22c83793f178e032d7f13bfcd7ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767667262","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Land Drifters is a game about exploring new islands, leveling up new skills, and unlocks through progression!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe world is set in a medieval-style setting with 